{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Marimomo",
    "steam_appid": 3602990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/5ede394cfa48ac9c0df3093c2c1347c6.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The more you care, the more momos you collect!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/b0cdd45fb0eaecdc6daec4074b9af097.poster.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/b0cdd45fb0eaecdc6daec4074b9af097.webm?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/b0cdd45fb0eaecdc6daec4074b9af097.mp4?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 500 designs prepared for the full game, you\u2019ll collect a cluster of soggy, circular companions! Then select up to three of your latest favorites to float around in your bowl. You\u2019ll find many momos with their own unique shapes, sounds, and behaviors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/6d5307e7df5e85ec6674c3c64dc54cc3.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay that\u2019s reward-focused and comfort-centered.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/9e6ea7cd2753953713d5d37eb593be69.poster.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/9e6ea7cd2753953713d5d37eb593be69.webm?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/9e6ea7cd2753953713d5d37eb593be69.mp4?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marimomo aspires to reward players without punishment, and its goal is to share a cozy and comforting experience. Get rewarded with your pick of decor items, bowl styles, cozy wallpapers, and <i>more</i> momos. There\u2019s nothing to lose, but there\u2019s a copious amount of companions to encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/b8ccaf120a49580df346afc7a4a7f5f8.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help, comfort, and nurture your momos in wholesome activities.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/40068adddc60f35704c16b75e8ef2ba9.poster.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/40068adddc60f35704c16b75e8ef2ba9.webm?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/40068adddc60f35704c16b75e8ef2ba9.mp4?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Cozy, undemanding minigames will help your momos feel happy and content, but you won\u2019t be penalized if you miss out on their care! By interacting with them, your momos will thank you in Bubble Coins. Save up to decorate your homely habitat, or spend them on the Momo Machine\u2014 where you can get even more buoyant buddies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/3f06eb269321f6c2b40a175f47b8eeb4.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy immersive and satisfying interactions!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/715881649f1596f209263cd4281e500a.poster.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/715881649f1596f209263cd4281e500a.webm?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/715881649f1596f209263cd4281e500a.mp4?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marimomo\u2019s game-feel is focused on tactile, responsive, and sensory play. Grab, wiggle, carry, twist, turn, toss, and more with in-game objects\u2014 including your own momos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/734c95deb379565c410567b34f5380be.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your momos on your time, without worrying about pet death or other common virtual pet penalties. You can check in on them anytime that's most convenient for you, with no punishments for being too busy. No risk, no commitment\u2014 just you, your hydrated habitat, and your faithful floaty friends are ready for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Original Music</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music written and produced by Leif M. Schaffland of Goatthrone Audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Voice Talents</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Adam Shelton</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dani Finn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 David John-Bores</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 purpurina</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fonts</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u201cGaegu\u201d by JIKJI SOFT </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u201cMore\u201d and \u201cZiplock\u201d by somepx </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All SFX, art, design, and development hand-crafted by Guava Garnet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the help of the GDQuest, DashNothing, and Brackeys communities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This project is handmade by an independent, solo developer. During the early stages of development, any proposed designs, art direction, or concepts are yet to be finalized and could be subject to change.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/5ede394cfa48ac9c0df3093c2c1347c6.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The more you care, the more momos you collect!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/b0cdd45fb0eaecdc6daec4074b9af097.poster.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/b0cdd45fb0eaecdc6daec4074b9af097.webm?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/b0cdd45fb0eaecdc6daec4074b9af097.mp4?t=1746634094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 500 designs prepared for the full game, you\u2019ll collect a cluster of soggy, circular companions! Then select up to three of your latest favorites to float around in your bowl. You\u2019ll find many momos with their own unique shapes, sounds, and behaviors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/6d5307e7df5e85ec6674c3c64dc54cc3.avif?t=1746634094\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay that\u2019s reward-focused and comfort-centered.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602990/extras/9e6ea7cd2753953713d5d37eb593be