    "short_description": "Virtual pets, WITHOUT the responsibility. Care for cute marimo moss balls on your schedule, and never stress over keeping them alive! Find, collect, and nurture your Momos\u2014 all with unique designs, satisfying sounds, and surprising behaviors. There\u2019s a multitude of moss to amass!",
